    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405400/extras/fe4351d3fb201dd4914f0814f7542474.avif?t=1748030957\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping Ani is a psychological-horror game, where you play as Hajime, a boy who has to take something to his girlfriend, Ani. But be careful, the forest may be full of traps and strange creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the &quot;people&quot; you'll find in the vast forest, solve puzzles and learn the real history...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping Ani describes the events in the mind of a person who is falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405400/extras/376985cc3c24c63aebd71aec2f6250bb.avif?t=1748030957\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game there are descriptions of suicide, self-harming and blood, so it may not be suitable for all audiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also contains flashing lights and loud noises, play at your own risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405400/extras/025f0f3deab168ede4cee311de90989e.avif?t=1748030957\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features.</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original history </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Curious and strange creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic horror </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hand-drawn cinematics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Charming characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A comically big amount of easter eggs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock</p></li></ul>",
